+---
+name: hive
+description: Operate an installed Hive distribution safely.
+---
+
+# Hive
+
+Detect `hive` or `hv` once, save the executable as `HIVE_COMMAND`, and reuse
+`$HIVE_COMMAND` to inspect and operate the local Hive workflow. Before changing
+project state, run `$HIVE_COMMAND --version` and show the proposed command. Run
+`$HIVE_COMMAND init` only after the user agrees.
+
+Do not copy this skill into an agent-owned directory. Install it with the
+native Claude Code, Codex, or Pi package/marketplace mechanism instead.
+Remove it with `claude plugin uninstall hive@hive-skills`,
