 ## Open questions about the codebase
 
+0. **Native distribution acceptance is not yet evidenced in this checkout.** The
+   Tebako command reaches its configure step but this runner has no `cmake`; the
+   macOS arm64 and Arch AUR checks also require their native CI hosts. The
+   package, formula, AUR, and now non-skippable candidate-lifecycle acceptance
+   workflows carry those checks, but a real tagged release still needs their
