+
+0. **Separate channel repositories are not checked out here.**
+   `packaging/homebrew`, `packaging/aur`, and `packaging/hive-skills` are
+   deterministic publish sources, not proof that the external tap/AUR/skills
+   repositories have been updated. Release automation now replaces their
+   placeholder SHA-256 values, regenerates `.SRCINFO`, aligns skills versions,
+   and pushes each repository from the canonical release manifest; the first
+   real tag remains the external publication proof.
